<body>
<div class="app">
 <header class="masthead"><div class="brand"><span class="brandmark" aria-hidden="true"></span>송연진의 작은 세계</div><span class="header-note">YEONJIN / OBSERVE · IMAGINE · MAKE</span><button class="text-button" id="change-role" hidden>캐릭터 선택</button></header>
 <main class="intro" id="intro">
  <div class="intro-heading"><h1 class="choose-title">Choose your<br><span class="yellow-underline">character!</span></h1></div>
  <div class="roster-wrap"><button class="round-btn" id="role-prev" aria-label="이전 캐릭터">‹</button><div class="roster" aria-label="캐릭터 선택">
   <button class="persona selected" data-role="0" aria-pressed="true"><canvas class="portrait" width="180" height="200" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span class="role-label">송연진</span><span class="role-sub">EVERYDAY</span></button>
   <button class="persona" data-role="1" aria-pressed="false"><canvas class="portrait" width="180" height="200" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span class="role-label">데이터를 읽는 연진</span><span class="role-sub">ANALYST</span></button>
   <button class="persona" data-role="2" aria-pressed="false"><canvas class="portrait" width="180" height="200" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span class="role-label">아이디어를 만드는 연진</span><span class="role-sub">PLANNER / MAKER</span></button>
  </div><button class="round-btn" id="role-next" aria-label="다음 캐릭터">›</button></div>
  <div class="selection-copy"><h2 id="role-title">노란색과 새로운 도전을 좋아해요.</h2><p id="role-description">정돈된 책상, 춤, 그리고 주변에 전하는 밝은 에너지.</p><button class="primary" id="enter">Let’s go! →</button><span class="micro">← → / A D to move</span></div>
 </main>
 <main class="explore" id="explore" hidden>
  <div class="world-area">
   <div class="scene"><canvas id="world" aria-label="좌우 방향키로 걸으며 활동 이력을 탐험하는 픽셀 공간" tabindex="0"></canvas><div class="scene-caption"><strong id="location-type">EVERYDAY</strong><span id="location-name">나를 소개합니다</span></div><div class="ending-message" id="ending-message" hidden><h2>다음 도전은 계속됩니다.</h2><button class="text-button" id="ending-select">Choose another character</button></div><div class="scene-help"><span>← → / A D to move</span><span id="world-position">01 / 08</span></div></div>
